    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Friday, January 17, 2020 at 4:42:05 AM UTC-6, Terrence Jorgensen wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I want to fix the age group 11 intercepts to 0 and get the analysis in the order of 11, 12, 13, 14.</div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Use the <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">group.label= </font>argument (see<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"> ?lavOptions</font>).</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(...,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">11</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">14</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># might need to supply a character vector instead, but probably not</span></div></code></div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422500817000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0LvCgt-OLsqvmdwG_GEC6F\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div><div></div></div><div><br></div><div> </div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
